Jadval yaratish, DEFAULT va dublikat qatorlar

00:30.203 --> 00:48.952
Yashirin tizim ustunlari: ctid va MVCC xmin

00:48.952 --> 00:57.944
Tizim ustuni nomi bilan to‘qnashuv xatosi

00:57.944 --> 01:08.680
LIKE INCLUDING DEFAULTS va nusxalash

01:08.680 --> 01:21.055
TEMPORARY va UNLOGGED jadvallari

01:21.055 --> 01:32.680
Xulosa va tavsiyalar
